# ── never publish: the moat ──
# The film grades are the one input no competitor can reproduce. The arithmetic
# is public (that is the brand's transparency promise); the grades are not.
exports/
data/model.db
data/cache/
data/api_budget.json

# ── never publish: internal analysis + secrets ──
# FINDINGS.md is marked Internal/working and critiques the model candidly.
# SETUP.md contains real Google Sheet IDs.
# NOTE: a '#' only starts a comment at the START of a line. An inline comment
# becomes part of the pattern and silently matches nothing.
FINDINGS.md
SETUP.md
service-account*.json
*.env

